WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.556
Wukong plucked a peach from a branch and bit into it.

2
00:00:14.557 --> 00:00:20.480
"This peach tastes wonderful!" he said.

3
00:00:20.481 --> 00:00:23.232
[g@He ate another peach.

4
00:00:23.233 --> 00:00:29.251
And then he ate another one.@g]

5
00:00:29.252 --> 00:00:38.065
Each morning after that, Wukong secretly ate more and more peaches.

6
00:00:38.066 --> 00:00:42.258
After eating he climbed into a tree and took a nap.

7
00:00:42.259 --> 00:00:47.720
Time went by, and Wukong enjoyed his life in Heaven.

8
00:00:47.721 --> 00:00:51.268
Meanwhile the queen of Heaven was busy.

9
00:00:51.269 --> 00:00:57.790
It was almost time for the annual Peach Festival.

10
00:00:57.791 --> 00:01:03.507
She called for her maidens, Red Gown and Blue Gown.

11
00:01:03.508 --> 00:01:07.093
"How may we help you?" asked Red Gown.

12
00:01:07.094 --> 00:01:10.885
"The Peach Festival is tomorrow," said the queen.

13
00:01:10.886 --> 00:01:15.606
"All the important gods and spirits in Heaven will be here.

14
00:01:15.607 --> 00:01:21.091
I also invited the bodhisattva Guanyin, the goddess of mercy.

15
00:01:21.092 --> 00:01:29.657
Go to the Peach Garden now, and pick plenty of ripe peaches."

16
00:01:29.658 --> 00:01:33.578
Red Gown and Blue Gown went to the garden.

17
00:01:33.579 --> 00:01:44.796
As soon as they went through the gate, both maidens gasped.

18
00:01:44.797 --> 00:01:48.602
"Where are all the peaches?" cried Red Gown.

19
00:01:48.603 --> 00:01:53.102
"They're . . . gone!" cried Blue Gown.

20
00:01:53.103 --> 00:01:56.449
[g@"This is terrible!" said Red Gown.

21
00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:59.903
"The queen will be angry!"@g]

22
00:01:59.904 --> 00:02:03.223
Wukong had been sleeping up on a branch.

23
00:02:03.224 --> 00:02:07.629
When he heard the maidens, he woke up.

24
00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:09.908
[g@"Who's making all this noise?"

25
00:02:09.909 --> 00:02:14.272
he asked, jumping down to the ground.@g]

26
00:02:14.273 --> 00:02:17.231
"I'm trying to sleep!"

27
00:02:17.232 --> 00:02:19.131
[g@The maidens were startled.

28
00:02:19.132 --> 00:02:22.883
"We're sorry to wake you, sir," said Red Gown.@g]

29
00:02:22.884 --> 00:02:26.618
"We came to pick peaches for the Peach Festival.

30
00:02:26.619 --> 00:02:29.215
Do you know what happened to—"

31
00:02:29.216 --> 00:02:32.275
[g@"The Peach Festival?" said Wukong.

32
00:02:32.276 --> 00:02:34.037
His eyes lit up.@g]

33
00:02:34.038 --> 00:02:35.872
"I didn't hear about that."

34
00:02:35.873 --> 00:02:39.977
"Oh, it's a wonderful festival," said Blue Gown.

35
00:02:39.978 --> 00:02:44.022
"All the important gods and spirits will be there."

36
00:02:44.023 --> 00:02:46.673
[g@"That sounds like fun," said Wukong.

37
00:02:46.674 --> 00:02:49.632
"I'm sure I'm invited, right?"@g]

38
00:02:49.633 --> 00:02:51.724
[g@Red Gown bit her lip.

39
00:02:51.725 --> 00:02:56.142
"Um, I don't think so."@g]

40
00:02:56.143 --> 00:02:58.380
[g@Wukong was furious.

41
00:02:58.381 --> 00:03:01.501
"The queen did not invite me?@g]

42
00:03:01.502 --> 00:03:05.873
I'm just as important as any other spirit or god!"

43
00:03:05.874 --> 00:03:08.145
The maidens looked nervous.

44
00:03:08.146 --> 00:03:13.969
"Sir," said Blue Gown. "Where are the peaches?"

45
00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:16.448
"I ate them," said Wukong.

46
00:03:16.449 --> 00:03:18.304
[g@"I ate every single one!

47
00:03:18.305 --> 00:03:20.859
And they were delicious!"@g]

48
00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:27.359
"Oh no!" cried Red Gown. "We must tell the queen."

49
00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:30.784
"No, you're not going to tell the queen," said Wukong.

50
00:03:30.785 --> 00:03:32.895
[g@He quickly said a spell.

51
00:03:32.896 --> 00:03:38.656
Instantly Red Gown and Blue Gown fell asleep.@g]

52
00:03:38.657 --> 00:03:43.589
Wukong looked at all the empty peach trees.

53
00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:45.182
[g@He shook his head.

54
00:03:45.183 --> 00:03:49.837
"I'm in big trouble."@g]

55
00:03:49.838 --> 00:03:56.332
When Red Gown and Blue Gown woke up, they ran back to the Cloud Palace.

56
00:03:56.333 --> 00:03:59.724
"Your Majesty!" cried Red Gown.

57
00:03:59.725 --> 00:04:02.588
[g@"Something terrible has happened!

58
00:04:02.589 --> 00:04:06.110
Sun Wukong ate all the peaches!"@g]

59
00:04:06.111 --> 00:04:11.480
"He got very angry and cast a spell on us," added Blue Gown.

60
00:04:11.481 --> 00:04:15.735
"When we woke up, he was gone."

61
00:04:15.736 --> 00:04:22.045
The queen's eyes flashed with anger.

62
00:04:22.046 --> 00:04:26.204
She went to the royal court and told the Jade Emperor.

63
00:04:26.205 --> 00:04:29.441
[g@"That horrible monkey!" cried the emperor.

64
00:04:29.442 --> 00:04:31.752
He turned to his captain.@g]

65
00:04:31.753 --> 00:04:34.323
[g@"Gather 100,000 soldiers.

66
00:04:34.324 --> 00:04:37.100
I want Wukong arrested!"@g]

67
00:04:37.101 --> 00:04:41.869
The captain nodded and then left the palace.

68
00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:50.072
Meanwhile the bodhisattva Guanyin left her home on Mount Potalaka in the South Sea.

69
00:04:50.073 --> 00:04:54.413
She soon arrived at the Cloud Palace.

70
00:04:54.414 --> 00:04:58.233
"I'm sorry to tell you this," said the queen.

71
00:04:58.234 --> 00:05:02.114
"But there won't be a peach festival."

72
00:05:02.115 --> 00:05:05.851
"Why not?" asked Guanyin.

73
00:05:05.852 --> 00:05:10.931
"A monkey named Sun Wukong ate all the peaches," said the emperor.

74
00:05:10.932 --> 00:05:14.626
"I sent 100,000 soldiers to arrest him.

75
00:05:14.627 --> 00:05:17.973
They'll bring him back to Heaven soon."

76
00:05:17.974 --> 00:05:21.952
Just then a messenger ran into the court.

77
00:05:21.953 --> 00:05:24.544
"We need more soldiers, Your Majesty!"

78
00:05:24.545 --> 00:05:27.369
"What?" cried the emperor.

79
00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:31.453
"Wukong defeated the entire army," said the messenger.

80
00:05:31.454 --> 00:05:35.265
The Jade Emperor put his head in his hands.

81
00:05:35.266 --> 00:05:42.230
"We don't have any more soldiers!"

